  "aiContextParagraph": "The PSS Sleman football club has been handed significant disciplinary actions by the PSSI committee following a riot involving the team's supporters during a match against Arema FC. The incident, which resulted in a 3-0 loss for the club, drew attention from international football governing body FIFA. PSSI officials, including leadership, had previously indicated that severe penalties were under consideration, including the possibility of point deductions, to address the instability caused by the event. In addition to these recent disciplinary developments, the club had been focusing on physical training and tactical improvements during the league's international break before the incident. The club is currently navigating these organizational consequences while concurrently participating in the I.League Cup 2026/2027, where they continue their tournament schedule amid the ongoing scrutiny from national authorities.",
